Subject: [PATCH 1/2] dnf5daemon-server: Unify exception message handling

Consolidate the repeated exception-message extraction into one helper.
This removes duplicated catch blocks in the dispatcher.
---
 dnf5daemon-server/threads_manager.hpp | 28 +++++++++++++++------------
 1 file changed, 16 insertions(+), 12 deletions(-)

diff --git a/dnf5daemon-server/threads_manager.hpp b/dnf5daemon-server/threads_manager.hpp
index 3b5f7d418..e01d6718b 100644
--- a/dnf5daemon-server/threads_manager.hpp
